{
  "font_size": 0.4,
  "font_color": "#FFFFFF",
  "background_alpha": 0.5,
  "background_color": "#9C27B0",
  "Stroke": "none",
  "type": "AIsubtitle",
  "lang": "zh",
  "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite",
  "body": [
    {
      "content": "每一天都有那么一天，",
      "from": 0.0,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 1,
      "to": 1.08
    },
    {
      "content": "我都会看到有人在做我最喜欢的二头肌训练动作",
      "from": 1.08,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 2,
      "to": 3.82
    },
    {
      "content": "那就是哑铃上斜弯举",
      "from": 3.82,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 3,
      "to": 6.06
    },
    {
      "content": "这让我心潮澎湃",
      "from": 6.06,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 4,
      "to": 7.68
    },
    {
      "content": "唯一的问题是他们举不起来",
      "from": 7.68,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 5,
      "to": 10.32
    },
    {
      "content": "这不太好",
      "from": 10.32,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 6,
      "to": 11.45
    },
    {
      "content": "作为物理治疗师，我的职责是",
      "from": 11.45,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 7,
      "to": 13.13
    },
    {
      "content": "确保你正确完成动作",
      "from": 13.13,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 8,
      "to": 14.35
    },
    {
      "content": "这始于你实际执行这个动作",
      "from": 14.35,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 9,
      "to": 16.95
    },
    {
      "content": "你看",
      "from": 16.95,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 10,
      "to": 17.33
    },
    {
      "content": "因为这些不同的弯举动作实际上",
      "from": 17.33,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 11,
      "to": 20.35
    },
    {
      "content": "无法达到上斜哑铃弯举的效果",
      "from": 20.35,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 12,
      "to": 22.85
    },
    {
      "content": "因为它更有效地针对肱二头肌长头",
      "from": 22.85,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 13,
      "to": 26.18
    },
    {
      "content": "也就是负责二头肌峰形的部位",
      "from": 26.18,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 14,
      "to": 28.72
    },
    {
      "content": "最佳方法是找到一个动作",
      "from": 28.72,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 15,
      "to": 31.2
    },
    {
      "content": "能让长头处于更大拉伸状态",
      "from": 31.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 16,
      "to": 34.21
    },
    {
      "content": "这个动作能做到",
      "from": 34.21,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 17,
      "to": 35.69
    },
    {
      "content": "但必须正确执行",
      "from": 35.69,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 18,
      "to": 37.13
    },
    {
      "content": "让我教你如何做",
      "from": 37.13,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 19,
      "to": 39.09
    },
    {
      "content": "当然首先要调整凳子的角度",
      "from": 39.29,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 20,
      "to": 41.73
    },
    {
      "content": "因为几乎所有人都在这里出错",
      "from": 41.73,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 21,
      "to": 43.87
    },
    {
      "content": "还没开始做动作就错了",
      "from": 43.87,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 22,
      "to": 45.519
    },
    {
      "content": "这是因为他们把凳子角度调得太低",
      "from": 45.519,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 23,
      "to": 49.09
    },
    {
      "content": "换句话说",
      "from": 49.09,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 24,
      "to": 49.79
    },
    {
      "content": "你不需要退这么远",
      "from": 49.79,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 25,
      "to": 52.45
    },
    {
      "content": "试图让手臂后背",
      "from": 52.45,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 26,
      "to": 55.49
    },
    {
      "content": "这很容易做到",
      "from": 55.49,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 27,
      "to": 56.82
    },
    {
      "content": "但你可以测试自己是否过度拉伸",
      "from": 56.82,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 28,
      "to": 61.03
    },
    {
      "content": "你看如果手臂不在垂直向下位置",
      "from": 61.03,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 29,
      "to": 65.649
    },
    {
      "content": "说明你缺乏肱二头肌长头的柔韧性",
      "from": 65.649,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 30,
      "to": 67.869
    },
    {
      "content": "无法安全完成动作而不引发问题",
      "from": 67.869,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 31,
      "to": 70.009
    },
    {
      "content": "所以如果下放时手臂略微前倾",
      "from": 70.009,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 32,
      "to": 74.249
    },
    {
      "content": "但你知道自己缺乏柔韧性",
      "from": 74.249,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 33,
      "to": 78.4
    },
    {
      "content": "那该怎么办",
      "from": 78.4,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 34,
      "to": 80.2
    },
    {
      "content": "只需简单调整杠铃位置",
      "from": 80.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 35,
      "to": 81.78
    },
    {
      "content": "现在手臂就能垂直地面",
      "from": 82.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 36,
      "to": 84.5
    },
    {
      "content": "且不给肱二头肌腱造成额外压力",
      "from": 84.5,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 37,
      "to": 87.44
    },
    {
      "content": "现在我可以有效增肌而不受伤",
      "from": 87.44,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 38,
      "to": 90.66
    },
    {
      "content": "现在如何开始发力才是关键",
      "from": 90.66,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 39,
      "to": 93.47
    },
    {
      "content": "注意",
      "from": 93.47,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 40,
      "to": 95.77
    },
    {
      "content": "因为我们不希望手臂前移",
      "from": 95.77,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 41,
      "to": 96.11
    },
    {
      "content": "不要让手臂前移来启动动作",
      "from": 96.11,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 42,
      "to": 101.09
    },
    {
      "content": "如果一开始就前移手臂",
      "from": 101.09,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 43,
      "to": 104.09
    },
    {
      "content": "会激活前三角肌",
      "from": 104.09,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 44,
      "to": 106.12
    },
    {
      "content": "让动作更难完成",
      "from": 106.12,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 45,
      "to": 108.56
    },
    {
      "content": "我建议你只需想象屈肘",
      "from": 108.56,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 46,
      "to": 111.8
    },
    {
      "content": "理想情况下不要直接抬起手臂继续",
      "from": 111.8,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 47,
      "to": 115.5
    },
    {
      "content": "否则会失去训练效果",
      "from": 115.5,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 48,
      "to": 119.49
    },
    {
      "content": "因为重力直接通过前臂向下",
      "from": 119.49,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 49,
      "to": 121.75
    },
    {
      "content": "不再对肱二头肌施加力量",
      "from": 121.75,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 50,
      "to": 124.77
    },
    {
      "content": "相反",
      "from": 124.77,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 51,
      "to": 125.15
    },
    {
      "content": "你需要确保哑铃保持与身体有一定距离",
      "from": 125.15,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 52,
      "to": 129.139
    },
    {
      "content": "到了那个点",
      "from": 129.139,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 53,
      "to": 130.019
    },
    {
      "content": "不过你不能就此停止",
      "from": 130.019,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 54,
      "to": 131.739
    },
    {
      "content": "可以用肘部稍微发力",
      "from": 131.739,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 55,
      "to": 134.459
    },
    {
      "content": "这样能激活前侧部分",
      "from": 134.459,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 56,
      "to": 136.579
    },
    {
      "content": "但在正确时机",
      "from": 136.579,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 57,
      "to": 138.12
    },
    {
      "content": "因为我们知道",
      "from": 138.12,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 58,
      "to": 138.76
    },
    {
      "content": "完全屈曲的肱二头肌会在肘部产生收缩",
      "from": 138.76,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 59,
      "to": 141.8
    },
    {
      "content": "并伴随少许肩部屈曲",
      "from": 141.8,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 60,
      "to": 143.579
    },
    {
      "content": "这里有个关键点",
      "from": 143.579,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 61,
      "to": 144.439
    },
    {
      "content": "但你不应直接将哑铃垂直举起",
      "from": 144.439,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 62,
      "to": 146.739
    },
    {
      "content": "让它们处于正前方的位置",
      "from": 146.739,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 63,
      "to": 149.87
    },
    {
      "content": "相反",
      "from": 149.87,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 64,
      "to": 150.47
    },
    {
      "content": "我要你将哑铃拉近身体",
      "from": 150.47,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 65,
      "to": 152.69
    },
    {
      "content": "尝试用哑铃内侧触碰胸部",
      "from": 152.69,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 66,
      "to": 156.32
    },
    {
      "content": "因为这样能进一步激活长头",
      "from": 156.32,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 67,
      "to": 160.8
    },
    {
      "content": "将哑铃拉近胸部贴近身体",
      "from": 160.8,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 68,
      "to": 164.41
    },
    {
      "content": "只需到这个位置",
      "from": 164.41,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 69,
      "to": 165.67
    },
    {
      "content": "这样做会",
      "from": 165.67,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 70,
      "to": 167.33
    },
    {
      "content": "更有效地刺激肱二头肌外侧长头",
      "from": 167.33,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 71,
      "to": 170.66
    },
    {
      "content": "你训练的就是你看到的效果",
      "from": 170.66,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 72,
      "to": 172.68
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你在训练",
      "from": 172.68,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 73,
      "to": 173.38
    },
    {
      "content": "并看到肱二头肌内侧更明显",
      "from": 173.38,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 74,
      "to": 175.5
    },
    {
      "content": "那就是短头",
      "from": 175.5,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 75,
      "to": 176.56
    },
    {
      "content": "如果你在训练",
      "from": 176.56,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 76,
      "to": 177.2
    },
    {
      "content": "并看到肱二头肌外侧更明显",
      "from": 177.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 77,
      "to": 179.16
    },
    {
      "content": "那就是长头",
      "from": 179.16,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 78,
      "to": 180.26
    },
    {
      "content": "这个动作主要锻炼长头",
      "from": 180.26,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 79,
      "to": 183.0
    },
    {
      "content": "所以要确保动作结束时手臂",
      "from": 183.0,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 80,
      "to": 185.44
    },
    {
      "content": "在顶端稍微内旋一点",
      "from": 185.44,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 81,
      "to": 187.74
    },
    {
      "content": "现在关键点在于下放时",
      "from": 187.74,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 82,
      "to": 190.34
    },
    {
      "content": "你只是让肘部回到垂直底部吗",
      "from": 190.34,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 83,
      "to": 194.4
    },
    {
      "content": "然后再次举起",
      "from": 194.4,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 84,
      "to": 195.52
    },
    {
      "content": "或者可以增强这个动作",
      "from": 195.52,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 85,
      "to": 196.9
    },
    {
      "content": "通过利用牵张反射确实可以增强效果",
      "from": 196.9,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 86,
      "to": 200.61
    },
    {
      "content": "当我下放到底部时",
      "from": 200.61,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 87,
      "to": 202.27
    },
    {
      "content": "我知道可以通过以下方式增加肱二头肌拉伸",
      "from": 202.27,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 88,
      "to": 206.01
    },
    {
      "content": "将前臂贴近身体",
      "from": 206.01,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 89,
      "to": 208.91
    },
    {
      "content": "产生相反的收缩",
      "from": 208.91,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 90,
      "to": 211.53
    },
    {
      "content": "从而获得更强的肱二头肌拉伸",
      "from": 211.53,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 91,
      "to": 213.27
    },
    {
      "content": "然后主动收缩三头肌",
      "from": 213.27,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 92,
      "to": 216.21
    },
    {
      "content": "能让肱二头肌反射性放松",
      "from": 216.21,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 93,
      "to": 219.56
    },
    {
      "content": "获得更多快速拉伸",
      "from": 219.56,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 94,
      "to": 221.42
    },
    {
      "content": "然后迅速从该位置爆发起身",
      "from": 221.42,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 95,
      "to": 224.12
    },
    {
      "content": "充分利用这个拉伸",
      "from": 224.12,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 96,
      "to": 225.56
    },
    {
      "content": "反射性下放到底",
      "from": 225.56,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 97,
      "to": 228.2
    },
    {
      "content": "贴近-收缩",
      "from": 228.2,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 98,
      "to": 229.5
    },
    {
      "content": "起身",
      "from": 229.5,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 99,
      "to": 230.44
    },
    {
      "content": "肘部在此处发力",
      "from": 230.44,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 100,
      "to": 231.86
    },
    {
      "content": "向胸部方向拉近，然后再次下放",
      "from": 231.86,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 101,
      "to": 236.3
    },
    {
      "content": "我想看到三头肌在底部充分收缩",
      "from": 236.3,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 102,
      "to": 238.86
    },
    {
      "content": "卷起身体",
      "from": 238.86,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 103,
      "to": 240.209
    },
    {
      "content": "收紧完成动作",
      "from": 240.209,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 104,
      "to": 241.949
    },
    {
      "content": "你可以看到肱二头肌外侧非常用力",
      "from": 241.949,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 105,
      "to": 244.509
    },
    {
      "content": "下放时收缩，再从动作中起身",
      "from": 244.509,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 106,
      "to": 247.55
    },
    {
      "content": "每个动作都要缓慢控制",
      "from": 247.55,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 107,
      "to": 249.73
    },
    {
      "content": "因为要利用伸展阶段",
      "from": 249.73,
      "location": 2,
      "music": 0.0,
      "sid": 108,
      "to": 252.78
    },
    {
